<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个████牌头戴式耳机，在被人用来听歌时，使用者会不自觉地唱出正在听的歌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-██低价值异常物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>I want something just like this～Oh, I want something just like this～</em>——正在使用项目听歌的Dr.pigeon<br />
<em>Oh,I want something just he stop！</em>——被Dr.pigeon的歌声折磨到崩溃的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00221" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00221-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606508529" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590676061 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 14:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00435/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个蓝色四指环型握力器，其上用白色油漆印有“劣质产品® ”字样，当有人员把四根手指都伸入指环时，指环的半径将缩小10~26%，该异常影响通常持续时间从5分钟到█小时不等，期间该物品无法被以任何方式破坏<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/5<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82训练区域健身区C2号器材架<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-82异常物品仓库中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“喂喂喂你这样是拔不出来的！”——Dr.Gaster，选自事故记录-H0714</em><br />
<em>“哼！啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”Dr.Cerberus，选自事故记录-H0714</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00435" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00435" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00435-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3398699&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606508529" alt="Gaster Master" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3398699)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;">Gaster Master</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602080060 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 14:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00256/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个电风扇，当有人坐在其下方时，会认为他/她头上的电风扇摇摇欲坠。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>位于██市██区的一所学校<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-CN-64的低价值收容柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我的天哪！这个电风扇怎么在摆动，要是掉下来怎么办！——一脸惊恐的荣特工<br />
这个电风扇用来测试特工也不错。——Storeshoes博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00256" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00256" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00256-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/storeshoes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056485); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6056485&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606508529" alt="storeshoes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6056485)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/storeshoes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056485); return false;">storeshoes</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592004941 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 Jun 2020 23:35</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00093/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">一个人形生物，并未认为有智能。皮肤为白色，高度约为2.38米以上，全身细长且躯干与身体比例严重失衡。当任何生物将目光注视此异常的面部或此异常的面部视频，照片时，此异常将会开始以人类声音啼哭。在1到2分钟后，其将用35千米到███千米/秒的速度冲向该个体，并且在用美式英语对该个体说“Happy April Fools' Day”之后试图回到收容所。目前看来，任何已知材料或者方法都不可能阻止其前进。</span>在2020/7/01时失去异常性质并变为无法摧毁的雕像。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/01<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██的前台，此异常被当作愚人节礼物寄往基金会。已提交关于是否可将此异常纳入普通SCP列表中的申请。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>在此异常的脚踝处写有：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>make sure ur havin' fun wis dis gift!</p>
</div>
<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">收容于Site-CN-75的人形异常收容间</span>收容于Site-CN-75的低价值异常物品储存间
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/26</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>from: SCP財団(JP)<br />
to: SCP基金会(CN)</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/27</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>SCP-096, the shy guy<br />
happy April Fools' Day!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/7/03</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>因在2020/7/01，此异常变为无法摧毁的雕像后失去了所有异常性质，对于将此异常列为正式的SCP的申请已被驳回。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00093" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00093" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00093-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/on-no" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5637670); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5637670&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606508529" alt="on-no" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5637670)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/on-no" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5637670); return false;">on-no</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587287518 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 Apr 2020 09:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00384/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一款被修改过的Edge Based on chromium浏览器，其中一切Microsoft字样均被替换为“劣质产品®”。当使用者的领导走近时，该浏览器会自动跳转至娱乐网页，包括█酷，█博，[数据删除]<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员ENC的电脑<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被愤怒的研究员ENC彻底卸载，安装包仍被保留在█奇云盘<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>这玩意在站点主管走过来的时候跳转到了[数据删除]！——研究员ENC<br />
ENC，下班之后把链接发给我——站点主管██████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00384" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00384" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00384-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606508529" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598799504 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 Aug 2020 14:58</span></p>
